text:
Q: Plugin conflict using CKEditor5 A: <p>This <strong>is NOT a node_modules issue</strong>.<br />
It’s a <strong>duplicate plugin registration problem</strong> caused by mixing:</p>
<ul>
<li><p><code>ClassicEditor</code> (which already has built-in plugins)</p>
</li>
<li><p>A manual <code>plugins: []</code> array that re-adds core plugins again</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Delete the below entire block</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>plugins: [
  Essentials,
  Autoformat,
  Paragraph,
  Heading,
  ...
]
</code></pre>
<p>Your config should look like this instead:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;CKEditor
  editor={ClassicEditor}
  config={{
    licenseKey: &quot;GPL&quot;,

    extraPlugins: [CustomUploadAdapterPlugin],

    toolbar: {
      items: [
        &quot;heading&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;fontSize&quot;, &quot;fontFamily&quot;, &quot;fontColor&quot;, &quot;fontBackgroundColor&quot;, &quot;highlight&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;bold&quot;, &quot;italic&quot;, &quot;underline&quot;, &quot;strikethrough&quot;, &quot;code&quot;, &quot;removeFormat&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;alignment&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;bulletedList&quot;, &quot;numberedList&quot;, &quot;todoList&quot;, &quot;outdent&quot;, &quot;indent&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;link&quot;, &quot;imageUpload&quot;, &quot;mediaEmbed&quot;, &quot;insertTable&quot;, &quot;blockQuote&quot;, &quot;codeBlock&quot;, &quot;horizontalLine&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;undo&quot;, &quot;redo&quot;
      ],
      shouldNotGroupWhenFull: true
    },

    heading: {
      options: [
        { model: 'paragraph', title: 'Paragraph', class: 'ck-heading_paragraph' },
        { model: 'heading1', view: 'h2', title: 'Heading 1', class: 'ck-heading_heading1' },
        { model: 'heading2', view: 'h3', title: 'Heading 2', class: 'ck-heading_heading2' },
        { model: 'heading3', view: 'h4', title: 'Heading 3', class: 'ck-heading_heading3' }
      ]
    },

    image: {
      toolbar: [
        &quot;imageStyle:inline&quot;, &quot;imageStyle:block&quot;, &quot;imageStyle:side&quot;,
        &quot;|&quot;,
        &quot;toggleImageCaption&quot;, &quot;imageTextAlternative&quot;
      ]
    }
  }}
/&gt;
</code></pre>
